---
// Footer Component (Estático al final del flujo de página)
---

<footer class="w-full bg-neutral-950 border-t border-neutral-800/80 px-6 md:px-12 py-6 z-40">
	<div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
		{/* LADO IZQUIERDO: DERECHOS Y ENLACES OFICIALES (DOS LÍNEAS, SIN EMOJIS) */}
		<div class="text-gray-400 text-xs md:text-sm font-mono text-center md:text-left space-y-1">
			<p class="text-gray-300">
				© 2026 Luis Pereida - Hecho con
				<a
					href="https://astro.build"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="text-gray-200 hover:text-blue-400 underline decoration-dotted transition-colors font-semibold"
				>
					Astro
				</a>
				y
				<a
					href="https://tailwindcss.com"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="text-gray-200 hover:text-blue-400 underline decoration-dotted transition-colors font-semibold"
				>
					Tailwind
				</a>
			</p>
			<p class="text-gray-400">
				Desarrollado y mantenido por
				<a
					href="https://sysadminctl.services"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline decoration-dotted transition-colors font-bold"
				>
					sysadminctl.services
				</a>
			</p>
		</div>

		{/* LADO DERECHO: GITHUB ACTIVITY SNAKE (AMPLIADO) */}
		<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
			<div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-4 shadow-inner">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 text-xs font-mono text-gray-400 flex-shrink-0 border-r border-neutral-800 pr-4">
					<span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">/var/log/github</span>
					<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-green-400 font-semibold text-[11px]">
						<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></span>
						ACTIVE
					</span>
				</div>
				<img
					src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pereidax86/pereidax86/output/github-contribution-grid-snake-dark.svg"
					alt="GitHub Snake Activity"
					class="h-10 md:h-12 lg:h-14 object-contain opacity-95 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
